     * You can use Vercel Blob Storage : https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-blob
     * Or you can use Cloudflare R2 : https://mlv.sh/cloudflare-r2-tutorial
     * Or you can use AWS S3 : https://mlv.sh/aws-s3-tutorial
     */
